          "printed_page": 9,
          "physical_page": 9
        },
        "cited_text": "Digitale Medien unterstützen den Sprachenunterricht gemäß den KMK-Kompetenzen „Bildung",
        "residual_flags": []
      },
      {
        "content": "Teaching in grades 5 and 6 builds on and extends competences acquired in primary school.",
